  "content": {
    "id": "p38-q9-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "State the range, start with $x^2\\geq 0$.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p38-q9-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=x^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y\\geq 0$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}x^2&\\geq 0\\\\y&\\geq 0\\end{aligned}$$\n\nEvery non-negative value is attained, with $y=0$ at $x=0$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
      },
      {
        "id": "p38-q9-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=x^2+4$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y\\geq 4$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}x^2&\\geq 0\\\\x^2+4&\\geq 4\\\\y&\\geq 4\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThe minimum is $4$ at $x=0$, and the function has no upper bound.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 19
      },
      {
        "id": "p38-q9-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=3x^2+4$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y\\geq 4$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}x^2&\\geq 0\\\\3x^2&\\geq 0\\\\3x^2+4&\\geq 4\\\\y&\\geq 4\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThe minimum is $4$ at $x=0$, and the function has no upper bound.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p38-q9-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=4-3x^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y\\leq 4$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}x^2&\\geq 0\\\\-3x^2&\\leq 0\\\\4-3x^2&\\leq 4\\\\y&\\leq 4\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThe maximum is $4$ at $x=0$, and the function has no lower bound.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p38-q9-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=4-3(x-2)^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y\\leq 4$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}(x-2)^2&\\geq 0\\\\-3(x-2)^2&\\leq 0\\\\4-3(x-2)^2&\\leq 4\\\\y&\\leq 4\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThe maximum is $4$ at $x=2$, and the function has no lower bound.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p38-q9-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=-2(x+1)^2-3$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y\\leq -3$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}(x+1)^2&\\geq 0\\\\-2(x+1)^2&\\leq 0\\\\-2(x+1)^2-3&\\leq -3\\\\y&\\leq -3\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThe maximum is $-3$ at $x=-1$, and the function has no lower bound.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      }
    ]
